      "ewTotal": 23,
      "ewPerc": 9,
      "napTips": 2,
      "napTotal": 8,
      "napPerc": 25,
      "expertCount": 2,
      "commentCount": 3,
      "comment": "The handicapper has relented a bit, dropping him down to a mark of 121. He's been consistent enough in his chase career thus far, winning twice and finishing 3rd four times from his 9 chase runs. He bolted up on his 2nd chase run, absolutely smashing Will Sting by 16L, giving him 18lbs in weight too. A totally dominant performance. He recorded his 2nd chase win earlier this season, beating a useful handicapper in Noble Anthem, putting 8L between himself and that horse at the finish. He was unlucky on his penultimate run. He was just upsides recent Ultima winner Myretown, about to throw down a challenge when still hard on the bridle, when coming to grief 4 fences from home. He was traveling just as well as the winner. A mark of 121 looks fine. He ran well here over hurdles, so we know the course is no issue for him. A big run looks highly likely."
    },
