      "commentCount": 1,
      "comment": "In the each-way market, a chance is taken with Héritier, who finished second in this contest last year and is having another go now off a 3lb lower mark. A winner at this venue over hurdles, he started his career over fences well before hitting a flat spot in his subsequent four runs. He has been quickly dropped six pounds in the weights, and new headgear is applied to sharpen him up. He has proven to be competitive off this mark in the past, so he's worth considering at around 9/1 with bookies going 4 places."
    },
